{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/rmwo7k","slideIndex":0,"text":"汇报范围：根据用户提供的调研材料整理，属于方案调研，尚无本项目实测结果。第一阶段假设室内平整地面。六自由度定位支持三维姿态估计，平地导航在 x、y、yaw 空间规划。\n原材料参考：FAST-LIO2 https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.06829\nNav2 Voxel Layer https://docs.nav2.org/rolling/configuration_and_development/configuration_guide/core_servers/costmap_2d/costmap_plugins/voxel/"}
