{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/laq25p","slideIndex":1,"text":"FAST-LIO2 是里程计和增量建图前端，不能直接等同于带回环优化的完整 SLAM。地图定位通常需要较好的初值。所列工程实现的 ROS 版本、传感器和 G1 SDK 适配需要在实验阶段确认。\n原材料参考：\nFAST-LIO2 https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.06829\nPoint-LIO https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1002/aisy.202200459\n地图定位 https://github.com/deepglint/FAST_LIO_LOCALIZATION_HUMANOID\nLIO-SAM https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/9341176/\nLeg-KILO https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/10631676/"}
